# =============================================================================
#  VXOST, whitelist policy
#
#  Everything is ignored by default; only the files that belong to the
#  distributable VXOST web root are explicitly allowed back in.
#  This keeps private customer projects, credentials and local data out of the
#  public repository by construction, not by convention.
# =============================================================================

# 1. Ignore everything at the root
/*

# 2. Allow only what ships with VXOST
!/.gitignore
!/.htaccess
!/.githooks/
!/LICENSE
!/dashboard/
!/img/
!/index.php
!/applications.html
!/bitnami.css
!/favicon.ico

# 3. The projects folder ships EMPTY: only its landing page is versioned.
#    Every real project stays private and is never committed.
!/projects/
/projects/*
!/projects/index.php
!/projects/README.txt
!/projects/.htaccess

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Never version, anywhere in the tree
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Claude Code
.claude/
.claude*
CLAUDE.md

# Markdown notes: none, except the README that presents the project on GitHub
# and the list of bundled licences, which has to ship with the distribution.
# These exceptions must stay AFTER the *.md rule: with git the last matching
# rule wins, so listing them earlier would have no effect.
*.md
!/README.md
!/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md

# Secrets and environment
.env
.env.*
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key

# Database dumps and local data
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Original theme backups (local rollback only)
*.foundation.bak.css
*.foundation.bak.js
*.bak
*.bak.*

# OS and editors
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# Logs
*.log

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  MySQL / MariaDB data, the distribution ships with empty databases
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
mysql/
var/mysql/
*.frm
*.ibd
*.MYD
*.MYI
ib_logfile*
ibdata*
*.dump
